{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're out drinking and boating with your friends, you crash into a small island where you have to fish using everything from fishing rods to assault rifles. Sell your catch, earn money, buy better fishing gear, and defeat boss fishes to unlock new islands and finally make it back home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Here is a gif:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001890/extras/f48f3fc8669e75969fd56336656d3673.poster.avif?t=1767714409\" width=800 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001890/extras/f48f3fc8669e75969fd56336656d3673.webm?t=1767714409\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001890/extras/f48f3fc8669e75969fd56336656d3673.mp4?t=1767714409\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Here are some more features coming before release:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Several small islands instead of one big island</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boats, to go fishing and to travel between islands</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More fishes, including boss fishes that have to be defeated to unlock the next island</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NPCs who give you quests</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A character model that isn't a bean</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some character customization</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New baits and upgrades for fishing rods</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More weapons, like assault rifle, brass knuckles, and dynamite of course</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Here is another gif:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001890/extras/a50b7f4c6d8a4e433c7151e183989c98.poster.avif?t=1767714409\" width=800 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001890/extras/a50b7f4c6d8a4e433c7151e183989c98.webm?t=1767714409\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001890/extras/a50b7f4c6d8a4e433c7151e183989c98.mp4?t=1767714409\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>And another one:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001890/extras/3744134439ff5f3eb5adc1f755461c79.poster.avif?t=1767714409\" width=800 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001890/extras/3744134439ff5f3eb5adc1f755461c79.webm?t=1767714409\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001890/extras/3744134439ff5f3eb5adc1f755461c79.mp4?t=1767714409\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4001890?t=1767714409","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4001890?t=1767714409","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001890/318bf20a0c111daf2e36441486e6ef97284a8f1a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767714409","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001890/318bf20a0c111daf2e36441486e6ef97284a8f1a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767714409","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id